1
00:00:00,458 --> 00:00:02,948
What can I tell you? She's a big girl.

2
00:00:06,097 --> 00:00:08,967
(Bernadette:)Wherever you look, there she is.

3
00:00:09,768 --> 00:00:10,998
(Bernadette:)More coffee?

4
00:00:11,202 --> 00:00:13,362
(Penny:)No, Leonard's taking me
to a physics lecture...

5
00:00:13,571 --> 00:00:16,271
...and coffee will just keep me awake.

6
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,202
(Penny:)Oh, I'll get it.

7
00:00:22,714 --> 00:00:26,414
(Amy:)Oh, looks like someone's
on Team Bernadette.

8
00:00:28,053 --> 00:00:30,353
(Amy:)- Where's Howard?
- He's not here. What's wrong?

9
00:00:30,555 --> 00:00:33,755
(Amy:)He had my car towed.
It cost me $200 to get it back.

10
00:00:33,992 --> 00:00:35,292
(Bernadette:)Oh, no.

11
00:00:35,527 --> 00:00:37,587
(Bernadette:)Where was it parked?

12
00:00:39,731 --> 00:00:41,221
(Amy:)In Sheldon's spot.

13
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:44,403
(Bernadette:)Well, that doesn't make sense.
Sheldon doesn't have a spot.

14
00:00:44,602 --> 00:00:47,502
(Bernadette:)Was it maybe in Howard's spot?

15
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:52,497
(Amy:)Don't play dumb with me, sister.
You tell your husband he owes me $200.

16
00:00:52,711 --> 00:00:55,371
- Well, that doesn't make sense either.
- Why not?

17
00:00:55,580 --> 00:01:01,020
(Bernadette:)Because I'm the one who had it towed.

